# Predictive Profitability & Sales Modelling System

Machine learning project analysing e-commerce transactions to predict profitability and identify business performance drivers.

## Technologies
- Python
- pandas
- scikit-learn
- Excel

## Models Used
- Linear Regression
- Logistic Regression
- Decision Trees

## Key Features
- Profitability prediction
- Customer and category analysis
- Feature engineering
- Model evaluation
- Business recommendations

## Results
Achieved strong predictive performance through model tuning and evaluation using cross-validation, confusion matrices and ROC analysis.
